 "description": "Level props, transparent background. signpost = a wooden signpost with an arrow-shaped board pointing RIGHT (c n B), leave a blank 12x8 area on the board (fill with P) where a logo will be pasted; flagpole = a thin pole (p q) with a gold ball top (B), full height; flag0/flag1 = a green pennant flag (G T) waving, 2 frames, in the top-left area at the pole's position (x 2-3 is the pole); lamp = a night street lamp with an orange glowing light (O B, q pole); bush = a dark green bush (g G l) at the bottom.",
