  "judgeReason": "Variant 3 is the most polished set overall. The signpost has a framed board, a brass rivet and a clear right-pointing arrow. The lamp reads best, with a cap, finial, a glowing core framed in orange, a collar band on the post and a flared base. The bush has clustered leaf shading with darker lower-right tones. Its flag frames are slimmer than Variant 2's, but they still show a readable wave with consistent shading, and the lighting and outlines are consistent across all props."
